<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Micron EPS view changed.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Micron EPS view changed.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston lowered its 1996 earnings estimate on Micron Technology Inc to $2.57 per share from $2.65, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Raised 1997 earnings estimate to $0.51 from $0.48.</p>
<p>-- Further details not immediately available. Analyst's office declined comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/8 to 23-7/8.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
